				<article
class="post-286 page type-page status-publish ast-article-single" id="post-286" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork" itemscope="itemscope">
	
	
<div class="entry-content clear"
	itemprop="text">

	
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="286" class="elementor elementor-286" data-elementor-post-type="page">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4be2814 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="4be2814" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a31cfd4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a31cfd4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-37d5ef1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="37d5ef1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Adres &amp; openingstijden</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e6cf3ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e6cf3ce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Onze winkel en gasterij zijn bijna dagelijks geopend. Actuele openingstijden vind je hieronder.</p><p>Adresgegevens:<br />Wasven<br />Celebeslaan 30<br />5641 AG Eindhoven</p>								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b6d825d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b6d825d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65677be e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="65677be" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
